  <escalation>
    <trigger>If idempotency needs a new store beyond r1's mechanism, STOP and escalate with the §11 answers.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <justification>
    <existing>IEventsCapability (006) create/complete; CompleteDecisionTool's idempotent-write pattern; notes/reuse-scan.md row "Tasks (events)".</existing>
    <extension>Both are reused; the tools are thin adapters.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Copilot users cannot create or complete a Spaarke to-do (FR-07 write half fails; "a retried create with the same key creates one record" cannot be met).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

